# wartrailer.grudge-studio.com — no runtime secrets (static hub)
# CDN assets live on R2 (grudge-assets). Upload with wrangler:
#   npx wrangler r2 object put grudge-assets/models/caves/2cave.glb --file=... --remote
#   npx wrangler r2 object put grudge-assets/videos/trailers/sections/<id>-flyby.webm --file=... --remote
#
# Cloudflare Pages project: grudge-wartrailer
# Custom domain: wartrailer.grudge-studio.com → CNAME grudge-wartrailer.pages.dev (proxied)
#
# Optional local tools only:
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=   # pages + r2 write for deploys
